+1. **supremeai-core patch (code)**: apply the supremeai-open event_bus.py telemetry try/except hardening (and the error_bus wrapper guard) to `Supremeai-bd/supremeai-core` — the repo Render actually deploys. This is a satellite repo; per the Single Door doctrine this addendum does not carry a patch for it.
+2. **Secret plane (admin)**: the trigger is a boot-time `SUPABASE_URL` fetch failure inside config validation ("Bulk secret fetch unavailable"). Restore/verify that secret in the vault the new container reads at boot; without it every deploy will fail at the same line even after the code fix.
+3. **Redeploy (admin/HITL)**: after (1)+(2), trigger a fresh deploy; expect port bind within the scan window and `deploy_live`.
